---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Composure Labs"
summary: "The tooling around ComposureCDK: first-party packages for AWS infrastructure, and the writing that goes with them."
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
permalink: /labs/
---
<header class="labs-mast">
  <img class="labs-lockup" src="{{ '/assets/labs/lockup-labs-dark.svg' | rel }}" alt="Composure Labs" width="303" height="64" />
  <p class="intro">the tooling around <strong>ComposureCDK</strong>. everything here is pre-release for now, and each package gets a proper introduction as it nears 1.0.</p>
</header>

<div class="section-heading">
  {% include "partials/ornaments/sparkle.njk" %}
  <span>on the shelf</span>
</div>

<ul class="shelf">
  {% for pkg in labs.packages %}
  <li class="shelf-card">
    <h2 class="shelf-name">{{ pkg.name }}</h2>
    <p class="shelf-summary">{{ pkg.summary }}</p>
    <p class="shelf-status">pre-release, v{{ pkg.version }}</p>
    <p class="shelf-links"><a href="{{ pkg.repo }}">GitHub</a> <a href="{{ pkg.npm }}">npm</a></p>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

<div class="section-heading">
  {% include "partials/ornaments/sparkle.njk" %}
  <span>writing</span>
</div>

{% set posts = collections.labs %}
{% include "partials/post-list.njk" %}

{% for thread in collections.seriesIndex %}
{% if thread.key == "composure-cdk" %}
<div class="section-heading">
  {% include "partials/ornaments/sparkle.njk" %}
  <span>where it started</span>
</div>
<ul class="threads labs-threads">
  <li class="thread">
    <h3 class="thread-title">ComposureCDK, so far</h3>
    <ol class="thread-parts">
      {% for post in thread.posts %}
      <li>
        <span class="thread-part-num">{{ post.data.seriesPart }}</span>
        <a href="{{ post.url | rel }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </li>
</ul>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
